WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:02,930
Yunzheng, where are you taking me?

2
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:06,370
Going home is as far as the moon bend

3
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,990
baby's home baby's home

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,030
Baby mother happy to go home

5
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,950
Mom, baby has flowers

6
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:18,790
The baby said she was happy

7
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:19,910
There are flowers in my head

8
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:22,430
Baby, I also have a lot of flowers in my head

9
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,460
Don't run if you step on the high bridge

10
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,260
I was in a hurry to pick you up in the morning and forgot to change my clothes.

11
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:34,860
Why are you telling me this? I won't listen to Rainbow Dash.

12
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,800
Baby, it's all your fault

13
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,560
We'll find an excavator to dig tomorrow.

14
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,740
Don't pick it up. The baby gets up on his own.
